# Tests

- Place automated tests under `Journeys.Tests`, following the existing folder layout (RulesEngine, Workflow, and so on).
- Mirror existing naming and Arrange–Act–Assert style.
- Prefer TDD on pure seams (rules, mappers, validators) when the plan says so.
- Do not add a second test project for production code that already lives here.
